# Icons · color · hover · enter motion

When a section uses icons or layered visuals, apply this pack.

## Icons

- Prefer project SVG/PNG packs (`@/config/brand`, science individual assets) over guessing Lucide
- Cream/default state → gold/hover state when both assets exist (`round-cream` → `round-gold`)
- Keep icon circle size consistent in a list (e.g. 52–58px)

## Hover (must)

- `cursor-pointer` on interactive rows/cards
- Icon: light scale (`scale-110`) + color/accent shift
- Text next to icon may slide slightly (`x: 4–6`)
- Cards: lift (`-translate-y-1`) + stronger shadow
- Buttons: brand hover + arrow `translate-x`

## Enter motion (left / right / top / bottom)

Use Motion with `viewport={{ once: true }}`:

- Left column / copy → enter from **left** (`x: -24`)
- Right visual / odd cards → enter from **right** (`x: 24`)
- Lists stagger **bottom-up** or alternate L/R
- Floating badges/orbs: gentle loop `y` float; respect `prefers-reduced-motion`

## Never

- Static icons with no hover on interactive lists
- Same enter direction for every element (looks flat)
- Motion that blocks reading or causes layout jump

## Done check

Icons readable, hover visible, enter directions match left/right structure of the design.
